   "text_before_clean": "NYANZA DRUG CO.\n(Incorporated.)\n35 W. 135th ST., NEW YORK CITY\nCAPITAL STOCK, $15,000\nShares $5.00\nWrite for information. The best paying investment ever offered our people.",
