   },
   "text": "Stock sold in blocks to suit the investor on easy terms.\nThe capital already in hand and the rapid increase of business means the realization of the Auditorium. This enterprise assures each investor Safety of Capital and Growth of Income. Call or write for further particulars.\n\nI. L. MOORMAN, Mgr., 83 W. 134th St.\n\nALLEN'S CLEANING ESTABLISHMENT 800 Fighth Ave., Bet. 48th and 49th Sts. Telephone Bryant 2535\n\nLADIES' AND GENTLEMEN'S CLOTHING CLEANED\n\nValet service, pressing, scouring, dyeing, repairing and altering neatly done. Suits sponged and pressed while you wait. Hats cleaned, blocked and retrimmed. Goods called for and delivered.",
